idxd can run the following idxd/iax device related tests from the
accel-config-test packages with various intel_iommu configurations:

dsa_config_test_runner.sh
dsa_user_test_runner.sh
iaa_user_test_runner.sh (requires system has iax devices)

The following parameters are required

DMA_IOMMU_CONF:
	"sm-on-lazy"
	"sm-on-strict"
	"sm-on-pt"
IDXD_ACCFG_TEST:
	"dsa_conf_test_runner"
	"dsa_user_test_runner"
	"iaa_user_test_runner"

You can find free systems using the beaker command line utility:

For system with only dsa devices:

bkr system-list --free --status=Automated --xml-filter="$(<idxd-hostreq.xml)"

For system with both dsa devices and iax devices:

bkr system-list --free --status=Automated --xml-filter="$(<iaa-hostreq.xml)"
